@title 3D view: the cabinet clears the toolbar after the first open, a fit and the standard views
@area 3D
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D
wait 30
shot first-open
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text front view
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
shot front
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text isometric view
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
shot iso
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text zoom to fit
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
shot fit
check_layout
note rolled up: the toolbar gives its room back to the model
click 33 75
wait 10
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text zoom to fit
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
shot fit-toolbar-rolled-up
